== Usage of _by_

- 在旁边；靠近：The telephone is _by_ the window.
- 用；通过：_by_ car; _by_ ship; _by_ means of
- 按照：Meat is sold _by_ the pound. / They’re paid _by_ the day.
- 之前：We can finish the work _by_ the end of this month.
- 经过；沿着：They came through the fields, not _by_ the hill road.
- 由（被动）：The book was written _by_ an American writer.
- 差距：The bullet missed him _by_ two inches.
- 由于：I met him in the street _by_ chance. / I took your book _by_ mistake.

